{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lordship is a turn-based 4x strategy where your objective is to be the first to obtain the set victory points (Fame). Explore, find treasure, build and expand cities, battle creeps and opponents, and interact with various objects on the map that automatically resolve. Increase skill based chances through research, buildings, and items. The game aims to provide a fun experience using\u00a0simple to learn mechanics with a\u00a0various strategic options and quick turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this demo, you have access to full matches but with limited buildings, items, and map objects. You can play solo or local hotseat multiplayer, and add additional bots.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3420900?t=1750337151","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3420900?t=1750337151","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420900/a3bb8723c2c613990ecdf17f83283f24e4450439/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750337151","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420900/a3bb8723c2c613990ecdf17f83283f24e4450439/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750337151","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lordship is a turn-based 4x strategy where your objective is to be the first to obtain the set victory points (Fame). Explore, find treasure, build and expand cities, battle creeps and opponents, and interact with various objects on the map that automatically resolve. Increase skill based chances through research, bu